<pre class=metadata>
Title: The Formatter Attribute
Shortname: formatter-attribute
Level: none
Status: LD
ED: https://arronei.github.io/HTML-Additions/formatter-attribute/spec/
Repository: arronei/HTML-Additions
Editor: Arron Eicholz
Abstract: This specification extends HTML with a <code>formatter</code> content attribute for
    <{input}> and <{select}> elements. The attribute is a template, such as <code>({value})</code>,
    that the user agent applies to the control's value when the form is submitted. The user still
    sees and edits the plain value, validation still checks the plain value, and the server receives
    the formatted one, without script.
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes, css no
Complain About: accidental-2119 no, missing-example-ids yes
Assume Explicit For: yes
